    "study": "Cranial decompression (OPS 5-012.0) with a primary diagnosis of cerebral infarction (ICD-10-GM I63), Germany, 2019-2024",
    "contents": "I63 subcode composition (principal-diagnosis output), discharge disposition (discharge-reason filters), and the all-primary-I63 utilisation denominator, by data year 2019-2024. For each year the cohort was rebuilt independently from the procedure and diagnosis filters, and the reproduced episode count matched the base extraction.",
    "disposition_codes": {
      "06": "transfer to another hospital",
      "07": "death",
      "08": "transfer (cooperative arrangement)",
      "09": "rehabilitation facility",
      "10": "nursing facility",
      "11": "hospice"
    },
    "disposition_method_note": "Only discharge reasons 06, 07, 09, 10 return unsuppressed counts. Hospice (11) was queried every year but returned <4 (suppressed) or 0. The field 'home_routine_other_hospice_residual' = N - (06 + 07 + 09 + 10) and therefore contains routine/home discharge, all other unqueried reasons (01/02/03/04/05/08/13), AND any suppressed hospice (11) episodes; it is a residual and hospice cannot be separated from it. 'hospice_11_query' records the raw suppressed query result for provenance only and is NOT additionally subtracted.",
    "source": "InEK DatenBrowser, aggregate published counts, data years 2019-2024"
  },
